I finally did it!

Major lesson learned:
  Never eat an egg in hell, especially if you are not Chaotic.  I wasted my
  amulet of life saving that way.

Minor lesson learned:
  A ring of conflict comes in quite handy in the endgame.

Most desperate moment:
  I used up my last couple of wishes from the castle wand on blessed tins of
  tengu meat, none of which gave me intrinsic teleport control.  I had to
  pile up all the rings o' prot from 2 barracks and keep zapping my used-up
  wand of polymorph until I got the last wish.  Fortunately, I succeeded in
  obtaining a ring of teleport control.

Equipment:
  I had blessed rustproof +8 Stormbringer and blessed +3 black dragon scale
  mail (both gained by wishing).  I chose BDSM because I had previously
  gleaned a cloak of magic resistance from a dead wizard.  My armor class
  was -22, including a pair of speed boots.

Interestingly enough, the game took exactly 56789 turns.

